    "text": "Let P be a finite p-group, where p is an odd prime. Let χ be a complex\nirreducible character of P . If χ(x) ̸= 0 for some x ∈ P , is it true that the order of x\nmust divide |P |/χ(1)2 ?                                                        T. Wilde",
